      "Description": "Test instructions",
      "Code": "/*\n1. Select one element in Archicad's 3D window.\n2. Keep Apply false and Run once to capture and preview the target.\n3. Toggle Apply true and Run once to write.\n4. Toggle Apply false and Run to re-arm. Re-applying an unchanged target must be a no-op.\n\nTapir supports XYZ. Tapioca supports Z only. Values are metres.\n*/;"
